WEBVTT

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.171
In this way, during the reign of Peter I,

00:00:24.196 --> 00:00:28.754
his victories were not achieved
by his new modern fleet.

00:00:31.009 --> 00:00:33.198
This would be all for today.

00:00:33.218 --> 00:00:35.573
Do you love your country?

00:00:35.593 --> 00:00:36.949
But there are 5 minutes left?

00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:40.186
We'll compensate with 5 minutes more
the next time. That's all for today.

00:00:43.013 --> 00:00:44.744
Is the oil ok?

00:00:44.764 --> 00:00:47.397
It's perfect, man.

00:00:48.557 --> 00:00:52.523
Today will be held the derby
between CSKA and Spartak.

00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:55.215
Aroudn 70,000 visitors are expected.

00:01:10.817 --> 00:01:14.535
Yea, yea, I'm coming.

00:01:18.321 --> 00:01:22.053
How sweet..vampires, werewolves, zombies.

00:01:22.073 --> 00:01:24.137
And all of this is in our education.

00:01:24.157 --> 00:01:28.084
We can't stay indifferent to that.
At least I can't.

00:01:28.617 --> 00:01:30.168
Yes?

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.961
I'm coming. I'll make it.

00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:43.091
We are you?
We'll be late.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.902
Radio Sport is preparing for the live
broadcast of the derby.

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:47.721
Hello.

00:02:47.741 --> 00:02:50.834
Hello, faster.

00:02:58.455 --> 00:02:59.769
Hello, Pasha.

00:02:59.789 --> 00:03:01.674
Good day, mates. We're going!

00:03:13.795 --> 00:03:15.945
<i>Attention! Doors are closing!</i>

00:03:15.965 --> 00:03:18.682
<i>Next stop: Kalujska</i>

00:03:27.638 --> 00:03:28.979
What are you listening?

00:03:46.605 --> 00:03:47.836
Hello, mates.

00:03:47.856 --> 00:03:50.032
Hello, Teacher!

00:03:54.402 --> 00:03:57.202
What's up, mates?

00:03:59.112 --> 00:04:00.343
Little one!

00:04:00.363 --> 00:04:01.705
Take care of the side doors!

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:11.377
Dear passangers, we highly recommend
leaving this carriage.

00:04:19.664 --> 00:04:25.063
It'll be a hell of a fight.

00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:26.384
<i>Station: Konkovo</i>

00:04:27.751 --> 00:04:31.733
That's the Horses!!!
(a name for CSKA's fans)

00:04:31.753 --> 00:04:35.680
Get ready! All together!
Come on!

00:04:42.675 --> 00:04:45.143
Come on, you cunts!

00:04:59.683 --> 00:05:00.916
Take this, you bastard!

00:05:00.936 --> 00:05:08.936
Move!

00:05:16.527 --> 00:05:17.927
Where do you thinkg you are going?!

00:05:19.695 --> 00:05:21.246
Take in the Major!

00:05:35.703 --> 00:05:37.044
The cops!

00:05:57.797 --> 00:06:00.432
Go before the whole carriage falls apart!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:18.539
None of this fuckers had decent shoes.

00:06:18.559 --> 00:06:21.373
Skullhead Crew! Skullhead Crew!

00:06:21.393 --> 00:06:23.778
Aren't you ashamed?

00:06:28.896 --> 00:06:35.618
CSKA and Spartak continue playing,
CSKA scores second goal.

00:06:36.568 --> 00:06:38.035
Silent!

00:06:38.653 --> 00:06:40.327
The score is 3:1 for CSKA.

00:06:47.324 --> 00:06:48.666
They shit themselves

00:06:49.492 --> 00:06:51.138
If they don't win the cup,
we'll have to visit them.

00:06:51.158 --> 00:06:53.960
Have we visited them lately?

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:55.307
Did you see that?

00:06:55.327 --> 00:06:58.879
Finally, where you've been?
Why didn't you call?

00:07:00.037 --> 00:07:02.131
We "danced" a little bit with Slon.
(Slon - elephant)

00:07:16.589 --> 00:07:18.152
He barely made it out.

00:07:18.172 --> 00:07:19.402
What?!

00:07:19.422 --> 00:07:21.572
We told you just to track him.

00:07:21.592 --> 00:07:23.684
Yea, and after that we decided to...

00:07:23.799 --> 00:07:25.143
What did you decided?!

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.728
Who of you two beat him?

00:07:39.517 --> 00:07:41.414
Are you stupid or what?

00:07:41.434 --> 00:07:42.985
Why would you say that?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.528
And what's that for?

00:07:46.019 --> 00:07:48.252
You stole his phone, too?

00:07:48.272 --> 00:07:50.781
No, it just fell out of his pocket
and I picked it up.

00:07:56.108 --> 00:07:58.577
Have you gone nuts?
Give me the phone.

00:07:58.611 --> 00:07:59.924
Where did you find these idiots?

00:07:59.944 --> 00:08:01.299
Slav, it's not gonna happen again...

00:08:01.319 --> 00:08:02.550
There's not gonna be again.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:03.675
Cut the crap, Yaryi.
(Yaryi - fire, passioante)

00:08:03.695 --> 00:08:05.175
Who do you think you are talking to?!

00:08:06.323 --> 00:08:07.261
Yaryi, stop, Yaryi...

00:08:07.281 --> 00:08:09.929
Wait, we have to discuss
something important.

00:08:09.949 --> 00:08:13.085
Dinamo are on the hook.

00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:16.001
We can organise something in the weekend.

00:08:17.161 --> 00:08:18.920
Full retards...

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.894
You should've started with that.

00:08:20.914 --> 00:08:22.144
Dickheads.

00:08:22.164 --> 00:08:23.505
Get out of here.

00:08:25.082 --> 00:08:28.814
Major, Dinamo don't have
decent shoes either.

00:08:28.834 --> 00:08:30.272
It's a shame to be kicked by them.

00:08:30.292 --> 00:08:33.095
On your place, I'd think about it.

00:09:08.437 --> 00:09:09.668
Yaryi, we must talk.

00:09:09.688 --> 00:09:12.586
For the third time this month, the cops
happen to be on the right place.

00:09:12.606 --> 00:09:14.866
So?

00:09:14.981 --> 00:09:16.868
Somebody's giving them information.

00:09:19.568 --> 00:09:24.676
Cops don't hang out on every station so
heavily armed.

00:09:24.696 --> 00:09:26.967
They have been informed about the fight
for sure.

00:09:26.987 --> 00:09:31.012
We just started and they showed up.

00:09:31.032 --> 00:09:33.013
Maybe it's someone from the Horses.

00:09:33.033 --> 00:09:34.265
No, I'm telling you - it's someone from us.

00:09:34.285 --> 00:09:36.253
No way.

00:09:36.786 --> 00:09:39.474
That was our first time with the Horses.

00:09:39.494 --> 00:09:41.060
And the cops show up for the third time.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:46.145
And what, before that Zenit told them?
And before them - Lokomotiv?

00:09:46.165 --> 00:09:47.286
Do you have someone in mind?

00:09:50.334 --> 00:09:51.886
Maybe I'm the rat?

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.888
It can't be you.
You didn't know about the subway.

00:09:57.213 --> 00:09:59.306
And I told the Major and the Razor.

00:10:01.591 --> 00:10:02.933
On purpose?

00:10:04.216 --> 00:10:06.267
And you suspected me first?

00:10:06.927 --> 00:10:09.059
By the method of exception.

00:10:11.803 --> 00:10:13.605
The fight with the Horses is a clear
evidence.

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.147
Yea, whatever.

00:10:16.805 --> 00:10:18.983
So what do we do?

00:10:20.558 --> 00:10:22.734
We have to cancel the deal with Dynamo.

00:10:22.851 --> 00:10:24.081
Are you crazy?

00:10:24.101 --> 00:10:27.444
It's going to be epic. We have been
preparing it for so long.

00:10:27.854 --> 00:10:30.446
Whatever happens, we are not cancelling it.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.591
Ok, so let's do this instead:

00:10:41.611 --> 00:10:46.802
We start a rumour among us
that the fight is cancelled.

00:10:46.822 --> 00:10:48.678
And on Saturday, in the last moment
we gather up.

00:10:48.698 --> 00:10:51.261
That way if anybody's giving away
information,

00:10:51.281 --> 00:10:53.041
we'll have enough time before the cops come.

00:10:53.783 --> 00:10:55.263
Major!

00:10:55.283 --> 00:10:56.627
Yea?

00:10:56.651 --> 00:11:04.651
<b>wWw.ZoCine.CoM
Watch Movies and Series!</b>

00:11:20.463 --> 00:11:22.779
I punished them myself.

00:11:22.799 --> 00:11:24.099
And how exactly?

00:11:24.632 --> 00:11:27.434
Are they in hospital or dead?

00:11:29.677 --> 00:11:31.700
I thought so...

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.813
And now I'm going to punish them.

00:11:34.764 --> 00:11:37.453
If you find them, you will.

00:11:37.473 --> 00:11:40.113
What did you think? That you give me
back my phone and it's all OK?

00:11:40.807 --> 00:11:43.288
If so, we'll do it another time.

00:11:43.308 --> 00:11:44.652
Give back the phone.

00:11:49.771 --> 00:11:51.126
Are those clowns ready?

00:11:51.146 --> 00:11:52.697
Slon, cut the crap.

00:11:57.816 --> 00:11:59.117
Are those your top people?

00:12:00.069 --> 00:12:03.410
What top people? We've gathred the little
ones who are not at school today.

00:12:04.362 --> 00:12:06.205
So do we start?

00:12:07.405 --> 00:12:08.635
Gather up!

00:12:08.655 --> 00:12:11.208
Come on! Let's tear them apart!

00:12:19.494 --> 00:12:20.795
Attack!

00:12:36.335 --> 00:12:37.888
Finally!

00:12:40.838 --> 00:12:44.362
Sincere apologies. I drove as fast
as possible and here I am.

00:12:44.382 --> 00:12:45.725
Teacher!

00:12:47.091 --> 00:12:50.908
You know I love you but you are dressed
like you are going to school.

00:12:50.928 --> 00:12:52.158
I don't like jeans.

00:12:52.178 --> 00:12:54.492
And I can't stand those disco clubs
of yours.

00:12:54.512 --> 00:12:55.742
Relax, nothing's going to happen.

00:12:55.762 --> 00:12:56.994
It'll be a humble evening,
just like you love it.

00:12:57.014 --> 00:12:59.787
Come, the Razor is already mixing it up.

00:12:59.807 --> 00:25:58.551
Hello!

00:12:58.764 --> 00:13:02.398
They are with me.

00:13:04.101 --> 00:13:06.665
I got something to say, boys.

00:13:06.685 --> 00:13:11.669
I have never told anybody. In short -
we've been together half an year.

00:13:11.689 --> 00:13:15.322
And this means FO-RE-VER.

00:13:15.941 --> 00:13:17.922
I want her to have my children
and then - grandchildren.

00:13:17.942 --> 00:13:19.173
I've become very santimental.

00:13:19.193 --> 00:13:22.300
When I see her in the morning, she's
so beautiful.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.661
It makes me wanna cry.

00:13:24.611 --> 00:13:26.175
Serious shit.

00:13:26.195 --> 00:13:27.591
Today I'll be generous.

00:13:27.611 --> 00:13:29.998
I'm buying.
What are you drinking?

00:13:30.864 --> 00:13:31.864
Beer.

00:13:33.449 --> 00:13:37.084
Mate, two of your best beers for my friends.

00:13:39.203 --> 00:13:42.338
I'm going to scout who's here.
I'll be back in a minutes.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.519
Where's your girl?

00:13:45.539 --> 00:13:47.102
On her way, she'll be here soon.

00:13:47.122 --> 00:13:48.464
She's worried.

00:13:57.753 --> 00:13:58.983
Look at those two.

00:13:59.003 --> 00:14:02.527
Yesterday lost the derby and today
are already celebrating.

00:14:02.547 --> 00:14:03.777
Pathetic footballers...

00:14:03.797 --> 00:14:05.141
Let's go.

00:14:11.301 --> 00:14:12.533
What's up, Razor?

00:14:12.553 --> 00:14:13.896
Hello!

00:14:17.972 --> 00:14:19.315
Good evening!

00:14:20.974 --> 00:14:22.940
Good evening, sportsmen.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.942
Eh, Whiskey!

00:14:25.476 --> 00:14:27.748
Whiskey and Cola - an obligatory
preparation for a good football.

00:14:27.768 --> 00:14:29.708
What are you celebrating?

00:14:29.728 --> 00:14:31.501
Do we have a problem, boys?

00:14:31.521 --> 00:14:34.001
You have, not us.

00:14:34.021 --> 00:14:35.544
Footballers...

00:14:35.564 --> 00:14:36.794
Go train!

00:14:36.814 --> 00:14:40.464
Look, mate, It just didn't work out.
Next time It will be better.

00:14:40.484 --> 00:14:42.130
I don't doubt it.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:45.465
One more loss like this and you'll
have a visit at the training.

00:14:45.485 --> 00:14:47.038
It won't be so funny then.

00:14:51.948 --> 00:14:54.041
Who were those?

00:14:55.407 --> 00:14:56.304
Doesn't matter.

00:14:56.324 --> 00:14:58.210
It's on us, girls.

00:14:58.743 --> 00:15:00.044
Thank you.

00:15:06.538 --> 00:15:08.630
And here we are.

00:15:09.249 --> 00:15:12.480
I have the pleasure to introduce you to
my very favourite gilrs.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:16.303
Their beauty, doubtlessly, will
save the world.

00:15:16.669 --> 00:15:18.094
Taisia.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.401
Daria.

00:15:20.421 --> 00:15:21.943
Yes, that's them.

00:15:21.963 --> 00:15:24.237
Yaryi, you are supposed to say
"nice to mee you'".

00:15:24.257 --> 00:15:26.308
Yes, extremely.

00:15:27.799 --> 00:15:29.572
And those are my friends.

00:15:29.592 --> 00:15:30.990
My brothers.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.407
Igor, Slav and Pasha.

00:15:33.427 --> 00:15:34.449
Pasha is now busy mixing,

00:15:34.469 --> 00:15:36.729
but will join us later.

00:15:40.847 --> 00:15:42.399
And what do you do?

00:15:45.932 --> 00:15:47.999
Was that an uncomfortable question?

00:15:48.019 --> 00:15:50.708
No, no, it's an amazing question!

00:15:50.728 --> 00:15:52.166
I'm impressed!

00:15:52.186 --> 00:15:55.836
Vova asked me not to embarrass him.

00:15:55.856 --> 00:15:58.325
Boys, answer the question.

00:16:00.191 --> 00:16:01.867
I'm a mechanic.

00:16:02.276 --> 00:16:03.827
Where do you work?

00:16:04.485 --> 00:16:07.509
In a service, I repair cars.

00:16:07.529 --> 00:16:09.050
Very interesting.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.427
Extremely interesting.

00:16:10.447 --> 00:16:11.968
This is Pasha The Razor.

00:16:11.988 --> 00:16:13.332
A famous DJ.

00:16:13.948 --> 00:16:15.429
So I've noticed.

00:16:15.449 --> 00:16:16.750
And you?

00:16:17.409 --> 00:16:21.558
He's the smartest one - a professor
of historical science.

00:16:21.578 --> 00:16:24.683
He teaches in the Moscow university.

00:16:24.703 --> 00:16:26.046
Which is named after me.

00:16:27.955 --> 00:16:29.256
Do you really teach?

00:16:31.581 --> 00:16:34.259
I just have a history exam coming.

00:16:35.208 --> 00:16:36.565
O, yea, right.

00:16:36.585 --> 00:16:37.815
Teacher!

00:16:37.835 --> 00:16:39.901
Bad story!

00:16:39.921 --> 00:16:45.028
Her teacher is awful, a cinic. And her exam
is made that so that she doesn't take it.

00:16:45.048 --> 00:16:46.445
And he doesn't take bribes.

00:16:46.465 --> 00:16:49.100
On the other side we have this
beautiful, perfect girl.

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.157
But her teacher didn't like her
from the very begining.

00:16:51.177 --> 00:16:53.976
And the exams has to be taken.
With a good grade.

00:16:54.803 --> 00:16:56.367
The question is: How do you get
prepared for such an exam?

00:16:56.387 --> 00:17:01.606
Come on, Teacher, I know you give lessons.
Help my girl.

00:17:01.722 --> 00:17:03.120
Razor!

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.108
I really need help.

00:17:05.142 --> 00:17:06.900
I'm very hard-working.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.789
I can't promise anything.

00:17:08.809 --> 00:17:10.041
Time will show.

00:17:10.061 --> 00:17:11.362
Here, he'll help you.

00:17:12.312 --> 00:17:14.196
We'll be right back.

00:17:17.441 --> 00:17:18.865
Going to the restroom.

00:17:19.815 --> 00:17:21.199
Excuse us.

00:17:29.655 --> 00:17:31.593
Boys, it's really important.

00:17:31.613 --> 00:17:33.803
The deal with Dynamo for Saturday is off.

00:17:33.823 --> 00:17:35.887
What? How come?

00:17:35.907 --> 00:17:38.471
We have info that the cops know.

00:17:38.491 --> 00:17:40.042
Where's that info coming from?

00:17:40.493 --> 00:17:42.127
From secure source.

00:17:42.243 --> 00:17:45.045
So you want to give up? We've been
preparing it for so long.

00:17:45.995 --> 00:17:48.297
I know, but we have to.

00:17:49.414 --> 00:17:52.438
They are the ones from the fight in
the subway. I told you, remember?

00:17:52.458 --> 00:17:53.688
It may have been them.

00:17:53.708 --> 00:17:54.939
It's them, for sure!

00:17:54.959 --> 00:17:56.398
Did you memorise their faces or what?

00:17:56.418 --> 00:17:59.399
Yes, exactly, and your boyfriend took
the most pain of all.

00:17:59.419 --> 00:18:02.859
And the one, what was his name, the Razor.
He tried to talk to me.

00:18:02.879 --> 00:18:05.389
I was listening music and he sat to me
and mumbled something.

00:18:05.464 --> 00:18:06.738
What a clown...

00:18:06.758 --> 00:18:08.404
I'm telling you - they were like
real animals.

00:18:08.424 --> 00:18:10.988
If you had seen them - I just don't know.

00:18:11.008 --> 00:18:13.574
I understand that you don't approve me
going out with Vova.

00:18:13.594 --> 00:18:15.270
No, not Vova..

00:18:15.678 --> 00:18:18.992
He's a producer, for him this is probably
something like a fight club.

00:18:19.012 --> 00:18:21.939
And the others are real beasts.

00:18:22.598 --> 00:18:24.120
We'd better stay away from them.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:28.066
I really want that teacher to help me.

00:18:30.102 --> 00:18:31.818
Do you really think he teaches history?

00:18:32.895 --> 00:18:34.250
Why?

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.085
Yea, right, like the other one...

00:18:36.105 --> 00:18:37.586
"the mechanic"...

00:18:37.606 --> 00:18:39.239
Let's get back.

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.758
I think we've met before.

00:18:49.778 --> 00:18:51.539
In the subway.

00:18:51.864 --> 00:18:54.678
I didn't know what to get you.

00:18:54.698 --> 00:18:56.248
What would you like to have?

00:18:58.117 --> 00:18:59.431
I'd like to have a drink.

00:18:59.451 --> 00:19:00.806
Great.

00:19:00.826 --> 00:19:03.002
Waiter! Champagne!

00:19:03.327 --> 00:19:04.796
Razor!

00:19:05.411 --> 00:19:06.641
Go deal with your music.

00:19:06.661 --> 00:19:09.755
I'm going right away.

00:19:21.169 --> 00:19:22.359
Good day.

00:19:22.379 --> 00:19:23.763
Good day.

00:19:25.632 --> 00:19:26.737
Tea? Coffee?

00:19:26.757 --> 00:19:31.559
Actually I only have an hour so we don't
have time for such things.

00:19:33.468 --> 00:19:35.949
What are we going to talk about?

00:19:35.969 --> 00:19:37.813
The Second World War.

00:19:38.553 --> 00:19:40.228
Ok, the Second World War.

00:19:51.143 --> 00:19:52.736
Shall we start?

00:19:58.021 --> 00:20:00.031
Are you ready?

00:20:01.565 --> 00:20:04.047
Let's check if you remember dates.

00:20:04.067 --> 00:20:05.297
This is the history - dates.

00:20:05.317 --> 00:20:08.118
The first exhibition of impressionist
artists is in...

00:20:08.778 --> 00:20:10.119
Excuse me?

00:20:10.654 --> 00:20:12.287
I thought we were talking about WWII.

00:20:12.821 --> 00:20:17.623
Well, you said your teacher is shit. So for
sure, he can ask you a question like that.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:19.100
All in all - this is also history.

00:20:19.742 --> 00:20:21.264
Okay then.

00:20:21.284 --> 00:20:24.711
The exhibition was held from 14
to 15 of may, 1874.

00:20:28.079 --> 00:20:29.726
So?

00:20:29.746 --> 00:20:30.964
What?

00:20:31.163 --> 00:20:32.716
I'm waiting for you to encourage me.

00:20:36.207 --> 00:20:37.523
I would do it, if I knew the answer myself.

00:20:37.543 --> 00:20:41.886
I thought you'd start complaining that
you didn't have it in your lectures.

00:20:42.671 --> 00:20:45.764
After all, I don't know everything.

00:20:53.801 --> 00:20:55.560
Well, I'm going.

00:20:56.844 --> 00:20:59.228
When will be the next lesson?

00:20:59.846 --> 00:21:01.076
Saturday?

00:21:01.096 --> 00:21:02.618
No, I can't.

00:21:02.638 --> 00:21:04.523
I'm busy on Sunday, too.

00:21:05.683 --> 00:21:08.246
I have things to do.

00:21:08.266 --> 00:21:10.651
Vova said that the thing on Saturday
is cancelled.

00:21:13.602 --> 00:21:14.916
Yes, It's true.

00:21:14.936 --> 00:21:16.822
Then...

00:21:17.146 --> 00:21:18.572
let's leave it for Saturday.

00:21:22.984 --> 00:21:24.338
Hello!

00:21:24.358 --> 00:21:25.867
The meat is here.

00:21:28.319 --> 00:21:31.091
It's not bad at all, take a look.

00:21:31.111 --> 00:21:32.453
What do you think?

00:21:33.112 --> 00:21:34.343
No, I'm married.

00:21:34.363 --> 00:21:36.206
She is, too, so what?

00:21:37.156 --> 00:21:38.500
Hello, there mates!

00:21:38.524 --> 00:21:45.027
<b>wWw.ZoCine.CoM
Watch Movies and Series!</b>

00:21:48.495 --> 00:21:49.769
Now they're gonna take it hard.

00:21:49.789 --> 00:21:51.089
We'll even have a meal.

00:21:56.624 --> 00:21:57.825
The meat is fine, don't worry.

00:21:59.584 --> 00:22:01.512
And where are the sticks?

00:22:01.878 --> 00:22:03.191
No one told me to bring them.

00:22:03.211 --> 00:22:06.526
Couldn't you figured it out yourself?
How do you think we'll eat the meat?

00:22:06.546 --> 00:22:08.611
Anatolyi, what have you been doing lately?

00:22:08.631 --> 00:22:11.862
Don't you know that Dynamo expect us to
have a party, grill and amusement?

00:22:11.882 --> 00:22:15.699
And what happens? We just stay and stare
at the meat in the bucket, ye?

00:22:15.719 --> 00:22:17.770
Go get the sticks.

00:22:18.136 --> 00:22:19.450
But why always me?

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:22.604
Okay, Yaryi's coming. Ask him to go.

00:22:33.019 --> 00:22:35.404
Is it okay?
Perfect.

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:46.035
Hello? Yes?

00:22:47.401 --> 00:22:48.631
You bastard!

00:22:48.651 --> 00:22:49.994
What do you think this is?

00:22:50.944 --> 00:22:53.551
What do you mean "there may be a fight"?

00:22:53.571 --> 00:22:58.429
Do you think that calling the special
forces is like to order a pizza?

00:22:58.449 --> 00:23:00.206
Enough!

00:23:07.494 --> 00:23:09.046
Hey, you!

00:23:13.164 --> 00:23:13.979
What's going on?

00:23:13.999 --> 00:23:16.049
Is there going to be a fight or not?

00:23:16.249 --> 00:23:17.813
What's this bulshit?

00:23:17.833 --> 00:23:19.885
We decided so that the cops don't come.

00:23:19.918 --> 00:23:24.067
Ha, so let's first do the fight and then
call the cops.

00:23:24.087 --> 00:23:26.679
That way they won't get us, for sure.

00:23:28.172 --> 00:23:29.597
Little one, faster.

00:23:32.924 --> 00:23:34.278
What's up with the fire?

00:23:34.298 --> 00:23:35.977
It'll be ready soon, relax.

00:23:39.928 --> 00:23:41.895
Operation "Bar&Grill" in action.

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:49.482
What are you doing here?
I told you to wait for the ambush.

00:23:50.767 --> 00:23:52.414
We're going to the others.

00:23:52.434 --> 00:23:54.833
You came to eat meat or what?

00:23:54.853 --> 00:23:56.250
Be more careful.

00:23:56.270 --> 00:23:58.072
Okay, okay...

00:24:01.106 --> 00:24:03.990
<i>Igor, you are not picking up your phone.
You shouldn't do that. Taisia.</i>

00:24:04.024 --> 00:24:05.575
What's going on?

00:24:06.525 --> 00:24:08.366
Nothing, for now, we wait.

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:23.084
Where are they, damn it?

00:24:44.460 --> 00:24:45.762
Look!

00:24:47.963 --> 00:24:49.348
Quiet! Quiet!

00:24:51.299 --> 00:24:53.182
Maybe he's from Dynamo, a spy.

00:24:55.176 --> 00:24:57.558
Only Dynamo can have such a fat spy.

00:24:59.553 --> 00:25:00.894
Major.

00:25:13.100 --> 00:25:14.623
Excuse me, mate, can you come for a minute?

00:25:14.643 --> 00:25:16.291
Who? Me?
Yes, come over.

00:25:16.311 --> 00:25:17.988
But... I'm in a hurry.
What do you want?

00:25:18.938 --> 00:25:20.378
Boys, here's the deal.
I'm not alone.

00:25:22.398 --> 00:25:23.948
I'm with a girl.

00:25:24.065 --> 00:25:25.907
We went for a walk.

00:25:26.649 --> 00:25:28.117
Because I love her.

00:25:29.651 --> 00:25:31.035
Come on, come on.

00:25:31.985 --> 00:25:32.967
Give me the phone.

00:25:32.987 --> 00:25:34.550
I can't, she's gonna call me in a while.

00:25:34.570 --> 00:25:35.883
Give me the phone!

00:25:35.903 --> 00:25:37.705
Together, we are going to the shop...

00:25:38.656 --> 00:25:40.595
Your shoes are shit.

00:25:40.615 --> 00:25:42.457
What? No, they are nice.

00:25:42.699 --> 00:25:44.252
I bought the myself.

00:25:44.993 --> 00:25:46.542
No, they're very shit.

00:25:49.787 --> 00:25:51.435
Shit? Well, maybe we have different tastes.

00:25:51.455 --> 00:25:54.226
You are lying to me.
Who's that text for?

00:25:54.246 --> 00:25:56.049
For my girlfriend, I swear!

00:25:57.915 --> 00:26:00.216
Just give me back my phone,
It's a gift from my mother.

00:26:01.042 --> 00:26:03.011
Welcome!

00:26:03.127 --> 00:26:04.565
Dynamo's Batman.

00:26:04.585 --> 00:26:06.221
What's your name, Batman?

00:26:06.338 --> 00:26:07.804
Pepi.

00:26:07.838 --> 00:26:09.264
Hello, Pepi!

00:26:09.588 --> 00:26:12.056
Well, Pepi, you'll have to stay with
us for a while.

00:26:22.929 --> 00:26:24.812
What's up?
We're just leaving.

00:26:25.222 --> 00:26:27.398
No, we are not empty-handed.

00:26:28.348 --> 00:26:31.233
Around 30 bottle of champagne.

00:26:35.643 --> 00:26:38.028
They are coming!
Gather up!

00:26:39.103 --> 00:26:42.322
They are coming!
All together!

00:26:48.442 --> 00:26:49.825
Dynamo! Dynamo!

00:26:54.944 --> 00:26:56.788
Come on!

00:27:19.417 --> 00:27:22.009
Silence! We wait till get closer!

00:27:27.753 --> 00:27:29.178
Wait.

00:27:35.382 --> 00:27:37.226
Attack!

00:27:40.260 --> 00:27:41.686
Stop, enough. Reverse!

00:28:12.235 --> 00:28:14.621
One for all!

00:28:26.742 --> 00:28:28.376
Boys, the cops!

00:28:29.451 --> 00:28:31.308
The Austronauts!

00:28:31.328 --> 00:28:34.339
Stop the fight at once!

00:28:41.542 --> 00:28:44.439
Now I remembered - we left the grill there.

00:28:44.459 --> 00:28:45.690
You serious?

00:28:45.710 --> 00:28:47.052
My dad's gonna kill me.

00:28:50.004 --> 00:28:53.403
And I forgot my knife. My father goes
bear hunting with it.

00:28:53.423 --> 00:28:54.974
Silence!

00:28:55.507 --> 00:28:58.196
Where, do you think, they
found out this time?

00:28:58.216 --> 00:28:59.736
Teacher, that doesn't change anything.

00:28:59.759 --> 00:29:01.115
Seriously?

00:29:01.135 --> 00:29:02.686
I'm on probation.

00:29:03.844 --> 00:29:05.160
And I carry my passport.

00:29:05.180 --> 00:29:06.825
Are you this stupid to carry it with you?

00:29:06.845 --> 00:29:08.202
I forgot to leave it at home.

00:29:08.222 --> 00:29:09.743
Where is it?

00:29:09.763 --> 00:29:10.994
In the inside pocket.

00:29:11.014 --> 00:29:13.497
Pull it out - slowly and steady.

00:29:13.517 --> 00:29:16.123
And then stick it up your ass.

00:29:16.143 --> 00:29:18.319
They won't search for it there.

00:29:18.644 --> 00:29:21.027
Just put it quickly so It doesn't hurt.

00:29:23.439 --> 00:29:25.405
Very funny...

00:29:28.232 --> 00:29:29.671
Vyacheslav Plotnikov.

00:29:29.691 --> 00:29:30.922
I.

00:29:30.942 --> 00:29:32.284
Come with me.

00:29:32.694 --> 00:29:34.370
Switch with him.

00:29:34.695 --> 00:29:36.244
At least they don't search you.

00:29:40.322 --> 00:29:42.116
I was walking with my
girlfriend in the park and

00:29:42.136 --> 00:29:43.845
suddenly your colleagues
jumped out of nowhere.

00:29:43.865 --> 00:29:45.207
Where's your girlfriend then?

00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:48.930
She ran into the woods.

00:29:48.950 --> 00:29:52.516
Now she's probably walking alone, lost,
because she has no GPS.

00:29:52.536 --> 00:29:54.129
She's like that - a little stupid.

00:29:54.287 --> 00:29:55.851
I even call her that - Stupy.

00:29:55.871 --> 00:29:57.395
But I love her, she's my treasure.

00:29:57.415 --> 00:30:00.186
She cooks great, and for me that's enough
to be happy.

00:30:00.206 --> 00:30:04.676
Your people handcuffed me, hit me several
times and rushed me into the vehicle.

00:30:05.210 --> 00:30:06.566
Where do you work?

00:30:06.586 --> 00:30:08.526
I'm a mechanic, I work in a garage.

00:30:08.546 --> 00:30:12.695
Don't you think I got better things to do?
Why would I go around beating people?

00:30:12.715 --> 00:30:14.264
I'm 30 years old, after all.

00:30:15.549 --> 00:30:17.015
28, actually.

00:30:18.383 --> 00:30:19.698
Major Homutov.

00:30:19.718 --> 00:30:21.477
Why do you need him here?

00:30:23.970 --> 00:30:29.619
What's up, Slav, are you ashamed?
You're so nicely dressed.

00:30:29.639 --> 00:30:31.898
Show us.

00:30:32.640 --> 00:30:35.026
Come on, show us the real art.

00:30:35.226 --> 00:30:38.360
What are you looking at?
Get your clothes off!

00:30:47.982 --> 00:30:50.366
And he's a mechanic, yes.

00:30:52.984 --> 00:30:55.368
Oh, God, you are like a painting.

00:30:57.320 --> 00:30:58.996
Wow, what are these things on you?

00:31:01.614 --> 00:31:03.553
What are these scratches?

00:31:03.573 --> 00:31:05.638
Scratches are done in prison.
Those are tattoos.

00:31:05.658 --> 00:31:08.794
Can I touch?
No, you can't.

00:31:11.910 --> 00:31:13.879
We've got nothing.

00:31:13.995 --> 00:31:15.559
Step wider!

00:31:15.579 --> 00:31:17.226
So we've got completely nothing?

00:31:17.246 --> 00:31:19.548
As usual - they don't turn each other in.

00:31:20.082 --> 00:31:22.729
Write them tickets for improper crossing
of the steet and that's it.

00:31:22.749 --> 00:31:24.398
For how long are you going to hold them?

00:31:24.418 --> 00:31:25.898
Not more than an hour.

00:31:25.918 --> 00:31:27.649
Don't let them go till tomorrow!
Fucking cunts!

00:31:27.669 --> 00:31:29.845
Tomorrow?
2 hours the most.

00:31:33.922 --> 00:31:35.265
To the wall!

00:31:37.258 --> 00:31:39.141
What can be done about this one?

00:31:41.635 --> 00:31:44.561
I already told you - you can erase them
with a laser.

00:31:46.094 --> 00:31:50.661
It can be hidden with another tattoo,
it just have to fit.

00:31:50.681 --> 00:31:53.578
Get a butterfly or some chick.

00:31:53.598 --> 00:31:55.066
Are they done by a professionalist?

00:31:56.100 --> 00:31:57.999
How much does it cost?

00:31:58.019 --> 00:31:59.957
300 dollars for a one with the size
of a box with matches.

00:31:59.977 --> 00:32:01.081
How much?!

00:32:01.101 --> 00:32:02.779
Do you have a box with matches?

00:32:04.772 --> 00:32:06.003
That's gonna cost like 600 dollars.

00:32:06.023 --> 00:32:07.363
Okay, okay.

00:32:10.400 --> 00:32:12.491
How do you make enough money as a mechanic?

00:32:14.861 --> 00:32:16.745
I took a loan.

00:32:17.278 --> 00:32:19.258
Vladimir Vetrov?

00:32:19.278 --> 00:32:20.288
What about him?

00:32:20.530 --> 00:32:22.164
He's dead.

00:32:32.702 --> 00:32:34.587
Charge up!

00:32:40.623 --> 00:32:43.092
Get those irons away!

00:32:48.545 --> 00:32:50.927
Write in the report that I have resurrected.

00:32:50.952 --> 00:32:53.120
Not on the third day, but after an hour.

00:32:55.131 --> 00:32:57.681
But I doubt anyone would believe that.

00:33:02.509 --> 00:33:03.852
Idiot.

00:33:06.470 --> 00:33:08.144
The cops took the hook so easily.

00:33:08.387 --> 00:33:09.948
If he doesn't move, then it's a corpse.

00:33:10.055 --> 00:33:11.773
You take it.

00:33:11.807 --> 00:33:15.024
'We don't have the right
to escort corpses.'

00:33:15.140 --> 00:33:17.414
and while we waiting for the hearse...

00:33:17.434 --> 00:33:21.291
And all of a sudden - shock!
He's got a pulse!

00:33:21.311 --> 00:33:23.444
You are pure evil, man.

00:33:23.477 --> 00:33:26.906
At least she knew what to do,
unlike most of the doctors.

00:33:28.065 --> 00:33:30.128
And she was pretty hot.

00:33:30.148 --> 00:33:33.131
Before I'd say, I'd do her.

00:33:33.151 --> 00:33:35.533
But now I'm with Taia.

00:33:36.069 --> 00:33:38.162
No, actually I'd do her even now.

00:33:40.155 --> 00:33:43.970
The rest was like always: they drive me,
I resurrect,

00:33:43.990 --> 00:33:46.804
I refuse treatment and here I am.

00:33:46.824 --> 00:33:49.932
Yaryi, how do you think
the cops knew this me?

00:33:49.952 --> 00:33:52.015
Maybe Dynamo brought them?

00:33:52.035 --> 00:33:54.209
Yea, right. They are 30,
we - 10

00:33:55.662 --> 00:33:57.643
They didn't need the "austronauts" for sure.

00:33:57.663 --> 00:33:59.006
Is that right, Yaryi?

00:33:59.956 --> 00:34:02.313
Why are you asking only him?

00:34:02.333 --> 00:34:04.008
Leave it, I can't think anymore.

00:34:05.583 --> 00:34:08.384
You almost died today.

00:34:15.589 --> 00:34:17.223
Stop, I want to buy some water.

00:34:23.426 --> 00:34:24.726
He suspects me.

00:34:25.260 --> 00:34:26.727
Not only you - he suspects everyone.

00:34:27.678 --> 00:34:30.242
Razor and you - he doesn't suspect you.
Just me.

00:34:30.262 --> 00:34:32.160
I think he suspects me, too.

00:34:32.180 --> 00:34:33.702
You, what? Did I offend you?

00:34:33.722 --> 00:34:35.565
Of course, yes!

00:34:38.184 --> 00:34:40.277
What if he's the one?

00:34:40.603 --> 00:34:41.944
What?

00:34:42.603 --> 00:34:44.750
The tactic: In order not to get suspected,

00:34:44.770 --> 00:34:46.738
he mades up a fake investigation.

00:34:48.190 --> 00:34:50.698
He's not a fool, he may have come up with
something like this.

00:34:51.774 --> 00:34:56.216
Cut the crap, Major, like you just met him.

00:34:56.236 --> 00:34:58.436
Then what give him the right to
talk like that about me?

00:34:59.279 --> 00:35:01.246
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

00:36:00.351 --> 00:36:01.455
Hello.

00:36:01.475 --> 00:36:05.321
Sorry, I couldn't warn you that the deal
is off. We'll do it another time.

00:36:05.979 --> 00:36:09.073
You'll just get the promotion -
two lectures at the price of one.

00:36:09.898 --> 00:36:12.199
When does the promotion expire?

00:36:12.232 --> 00:36:15.327
Don't know. We'll see.
What about tomorrow?

00:36:15.651 --> 00:36:17.202
When?

00:36:17.235 --> 00:36:18.548
Same hour.

00:36:18.568 --> 00:36:19.799
Fine.

00:36:19.819 --> 00:36:21.870
Only this time without Dynamo, Okay?

00:36:23.571 --> 00:36:25.038
Okay, without Dynamo.

00:36:25.113 --> 00:36:26.706
Fine with me.

00:36:32.242 --> 00:36:33.876
Hello.
Hi.

00:36:34.744 --> 00:36:36.141
This is for you.

00:36:36.161 --> 00:36:37.545
Plasticine?

00:36:37.954 --> 00:36:39.795
Yea, you can make figures out of it.

00:36:40.579 --> 00:36:42.728
Is this a sign of attention?

00:36:42.748 --> 00:36:45.021
Let's say it's an excuse about
yesterday's absence.

00:36:45.041 --> 00:36:47.425
Nothing more than that.

00:36:49.419 --> 00:36:53.776
Beside, visualization helps in the process
of learning.

00:36:53.796 --> 00:36:59.306
I get it. Vova told me you were doing
something important together.

00:36:59.505 --> 00:37:00.863
That's right.

00:37:00.883 --> 00:37:02.557
Did you fight again?

00:37:06.593 --> 00:37:10.450
Did he tell you this?
Turn this off, please.

00:37:10.470 --> 00:37:11.813
No, I figured it out myself.

00:37:12.846 --> 00:37:19.400
Daria saw you fighting in the subway.
Now I know what you're doing.

00:37:22.435 --> 00:37:27.751
Good for Vova! "Where were you?"
"Fighting".

00:37:27.771 --> 00:37:31.490
For me it's intimidating to be in a room
with a hooligan.

00:37:33.274 --> 00:37:34.825
Because?

00:37:37.275 --> 00:37:39.952
You can't know what he'll do next.

00:37:42.486 --> 00:37:44.872
We don't fight women and adults.

00:37:47.863 --> 00:37:49.250
We just eat them.

00:37:51.866 --> 00:37:53.209
So - dates.

00:37:53.233 --> 00:38:01.233
<b>wWw.ZoCine.CoM
Watch Movies and Series!</b>

00:38:11.210 --> 00:38:14.586
Stalin didn't take loan for
his destroyed country.

00:38:14.610 --> 00:38:17.788
Everybody else did:
Germany, Japan - everybody.

00:38:18.714 --> 00:38:21.098
Because of this USSR is delayed.

00:38:21.340 --> 00:38:23.725
And the people had to make
serious deprivations.

00:38:24.551 --> 00:38:29.020
They died, starved but didn't get
into the paws of American capitalism.

00:38:30.929 --> 00:38:33.854
At least not then. But in 1991.

00:38:34.474 --> 00:38:36.023
I don't understand.

00:38:36.223 --> 00:38:38.190
Why do you fight?

00:38:41.641 --> 00:38:43.610
Taisia, let's stick to the history, ye?

00:38:44.143 --> 00:38:49.461
Let's say, that my bad teacher last
time asked about the impressionists,

00:38:49.481 --> 00:38:52.072
decides to ask me about football fans.

00:38:52.314 --> 00:38:54.033
We are not fans.

00:38:54.399 --> 00:38:56.547
We don't go to the stadium with
scarves and flags.

00:38:56.567 --> 00:38:58.742
Actually, I have to go.

00:38:59.360 --> 00:39:01.662
Yes, Vova told me that you are not
to be held.

00:39:03.778 --> 00:39:06.164
He's like an guardian angel to me.

00:39:07.697 --> 00:39:09.374
Bye!

00:39:11.366 --> 00:39:15.001
So you caught those ultras and you
let them go?

00:39:15.118 --> 00:39:20.643
There's difference between ultras
and hooligans.

00:39:20.663 --> 00:39:23.325
Ultras are on the stand,
with flags and banners,

00:39:23.350 --> 00:39:25.323
it's like that all around the world.

00:39:25.832 --> 00:39:27.480
But hooligans...

00:39:27.500 --> 00:39:30.730
This is totally different.

00:39:30.750 --> 00:39:36.150
They don't care about football. They just
fight with another hooligans.

00:39:36.170 --> 00:39:38.763
Why do you tell me these things?

00:39:40.756 --> 00:39:43.862
My son is a part of "Fronline Spartak"
since early age.

00:39:43.882 --> 00:39:47.531
Is it difficult to catch and put in prison
all these hooligans?

