00:58:32.798 --> 00:58:35.181
Not tamable.

00:58:35.381 --> 00:58:38.823
But he has money and that's
what you need right now.

00:58:38.843 --> 00:58:41.407
There's no point in having
children, if they are poor.

00:58:41.427 --> 00:58:43.811
And you can't make a living by teaching.

00:58:45.305 --> 00:58:46.617
Okay.

00:58:46.637 --> 00:58:48.202
Let's drink for Vova.

00:58:48.222 --> 00:58:49.662
For his sake!

00:58:49.682 --> 00:58:51.025
Correct.

00:58:55.101 --> 00:58:56.444
Thank you!

00:58:56.560 --> 00:58:58.318
What present did Vova get you?

00:59:09.691 --> 00:59:11.533
Come on, give ideas!

00:59:11.775 --> 00:59:13.090
Necklace?
Next!

00:59:13.110 --> 00:59:15.287
No, that's right - a necklace - to tie
her up with it.

00:59:16.153 --> 00:59:17.258
Very funny...

00:59:17.278 --> 00:59:19.455
Teacher, you are the smartes one.
Any ideas?

00:59:19.988 --> 00:59:21.218
No.

00:59:21.238 --> 00:59:22.790
Come on, think of something.

00:59:23.116 --> 00:59:25.624
The one who guesses, wins 100 dollars.

00:59:29.495 --> 00:59:30.724
Who's next?

00:59:30.744 --> 00:59:32.711
Golden rollers for her hair.

00:59:35.122 --> 00:59:37.713
Yaryi, you are my last hope.

00:59:38.039 --> 00:59:39.894
Anual subscription for the gym.

00:59:39.914 --> 00:59:41.146
I'm not sure I got that one.

00:59:41.166 --> 00:59:42.925
Are you saying she's not hot?

00:59:43.125 --> 00:59:45.302
No, but she needs to keep her form.

00:59:45.835 --> 00:59:47.303
Thanks for the advice.

00:59:47.711 --> 00:59:53.014
I raise the prize to 500 american dollars.-

00:59:54.382 --> 00:59:55.848
Come on, boys, come on!

00:59:56.674 --> 00:59:58.016
500 dollars!

00:59:58.757 --> 01:00:00.310
A tractor!

01:00:04.177 --> 01:00:05.408
You are repeating yourselves!

01:00:05.428 --> 01:00:07.120
<i>I want to have your
children, you undestand?!</i>

01:00:07.140 --> 01:00:08.660
<i>I love you more than my life!
Yours Taia.</i>

01:00:08.680 --> 01:00:11.577
But a real one!
Yea, what she's gonna do with it?

01:00:11.597 --> 01:00:13.149
Not her thing.

01:00:13.974 --> 01:00:16.067
Is that all you got?

01:00:17.434 --> 01:00:18.958
Attention, please!

01:00:18.978 --> 01:00:20.320
The right answer is...

01:00:21.685 --> 01:00:25.419
My gift for my beloved one
on her birthday is...

01:00:25.439 --> 01:00:27.711
A book!

01:00:27.731 --> 01:00:29.073
Quiet! Quiet!

01:00:31.192 --> 01:00:35.132
The book is called "100
meals of sour cabbage".

01:00:35.152 --> 01:00:36.785
Collectioner's edition!

01:00:38.779 --> 01:00:40.179
And what's her reaction, you think?

01:00:40.362 --> 01:00:41.789
"You are a retard."

01:00:44.823 --> 01:00:46.596
She said: "You're funny."

01:00:46.616 --> 01:00:51.085
And that's the biggest compliment out
of a woman's mouth.

01:00:51.201 --> 01:00:52.725
Not "I love you",

01:00:52.745 --> 01:00:54.308
but "you are funny".

01:00:54.328 --> 01:00:56.589
"Oh, Major, you are so funnuy."

01:00:59.831 --> 01:01:01.604
Hello? Silence!

01:01:01.624 --> 01:01:03.801
Yea, we'll arrive soon.

01:01:04.126 --> 01:01:05.551
Excellent.

01:01:06.418 --> 01:01:08.594
Okay, bye.

01:01:08.618 --> 01:01:16.323
<b>wWw.ZoCine.CoM
Watch Movies and Series!</b>

01:01:30.389 --> 01:01:33.691
One, two, three.

01:01:35.058 --> 01:01:38.818
The count is accurate here.
Owl, do you read me?

01:01:42.353 --> 01:01:46.322
I feel very sick.
I can't sleep.

01:01:47.481 --> 01:01:49.866
I've been wandering like I'm on auto-pilot.

01:01:51.316 --> 01:01:54.244
Excuse me, I'll call you back later.

01:01:56.320 --> 01:02:01.010
<i>Radio Sport - the best sport
radio in the country.</i>

01:02:01.030 --> 01:02:04.248
<i>Zenit against Spartak,
Peterburg against Moscow</i>

01:02:05.199 --> 01:02:07.471
<i>This is why awaits us today.</i>

01:02:07.491 --> 01:02:10.710
This is maybe the one match, for which
the legue deserves to be held for.

01:02:12.077 --> 01:02:15.170
Oh, such a princess this time of the day.

01:02:16.538 --> 01:02:17.767
Good day!

01:02:17.787 --> 01:02:18.922
Hello!

01:02:20.206 --> 01:02:21.758
I'd like to buy a T-shirt.

01:02:22.791 --> 01:02:29.885
We don't have many. We have many
polo-shirts. Pick something if you want.

01:02:30.503 --> 01:02:33.818
I have a friend, fan of Spartak.
I want to surprise him.

01:02:33.838 --> 01:02:37.891
If you let him fuck you up the ass,
he'll be more than surprised.

01:02:38.758 --> 01:02:40.100
Excuse me?

01:02:41.049 --> 01:02:42.601
What's the size of your boyfriend?

01:02:42.718 --> 01:02:44.157
He's not my boyfriend, only a friend.

01:02:44.177 --> 01:02:45.936
Anyway, what's his size?

01:02:48.970 --> 01:02:50.314
Maybe a little bit smaller.

01:02:50.930 --> 01:02:53.329
Passinate fan, you say?

01:02:53.349 --> 01:02:55.413
Who, me? No. Why?

01:02:55.433 --> 01:02:57.610
No, not you.
Is your friend ultras?

01:02:58.434 --> 01:03:00.528
No, he's one of those...

01:03:01.977 --> 01:03:03.944
Seriously? What's his name?

01:03:04.396 --> 01:03:06.335
Igor Toloknov.

01:03:06.355 --> 01:03:10.295
Ah, The Teacher? Everybody knows him
I've known him since little.

01:03:10.315 --> 01:03:11.877
Well, look who's decided to visit us...

01:03:14.067 --> 01:03:15.840
And how do you know him?

01:03:15.860 --> 01:03:19.257
Girl, he's a star. He has more away matches
than you rides with the subway.

01:03:19.277 --> 01:03:22.176
Look, I can always choose something for
Teacher, but we've got to celebrate.

01:03:22.196 --> 01:03:23.636
No way, I drank way too much last night.

01:03:23.656 --> 01:03:25.845
Well, that's for last night.
Today - you'll get healed.

01:03:25.865 --> 01:03:27.512
I can't even look at that.

01:03:27.532 --> 01:03:29.473
There's no need to.
Close your eyes.

01:03:29.493 --> 01:03:31.556
Think of the beach, the see...

01:03:31.576 --> 01:03:35.004
the simple summer breeze and things
will fall into place.

01:03:37.829 --> 01:03:39.505
Will you drink?

01:03:48.793 --> 01:03:51.066
No, put that down.
Dynamo wear it.

01:03:51.086 --> 01:03:53.556
You need something stylish.

01:03:55.756 --> 01:03:57.195
5000 rubley?

01:03:57.215 --> 01:03:58.445
Of couse, what did you expect?

01:03:58.465 --> 01:04:01.267
Every hooligans wears one.

01:04:01.592 --> 01:04:03.142
Shoes.

01:04:03.676 --> 01:04:07.533
Here - stylish, light.

01:04:07.553 --> 01:04:10.034
And you won't be ashamed to kick
someone in the face with them.

01:04:12.848 --> 01:04:14.190
Good choice.
Thanks!

01:04:16.182 --> 01:04:18.066
I would be proud to wear this.

01:04:18.266 --> 01:04:19.945
And why do you fight?

01:04:21.310 --> 01:04:25.363
What do you mean 'why'? Because we have to.
Because it's a war.

01:04:27.229 --> 01:04:29.210
So this is your war, is that it?

01:04:29.230 --> 01:04:30.573
In a way, yes.

01:04:31.107 --> 01:04:35.452
Look, the fist fight is something serious.

01:04:36.527 --> 01:04:38.800
Nowadays, the things around the
football are so overrated.

01:04:38.820 --> 01:04:42.217
Team fights, arrangements, how many, when...

01:04:42.237 --> 01:04:45.761
And everyone's doing it. There was a time
that around the football was different.

01:04:45.781 --> 01:04:47.012
Around the football?

01:04:47.032 --> 01:04:48.596
Yea, around the football.

01:04:48.616 --> 01:04:51.500
I guess they don't teach that at school.

01:04:51.826 --> 01:04:55.669
Around the football is that:
to track someone,

01:04:55.994 --> 01:04:57.964
to ambush

01:04:58.705 --> 01:05:02.464
and to fiercely punish the enemy.

01:05:30.512 --> 01:05:33.188
One's missing. Owl, do you copy?
I read.

01:06:05.614 --> 01:06:07.999
Did they pass by you?

01:06:10.408 --> 01:06:11.408
Yes.

01:06:11.867 --> 01:06:13.307
Where could have they pulled over?

01:06:13.327 --> 01:06:16.878
There's a side road about 5km. from here.
Maybe there.

01:07:07.312 --> 01:07:08.779
I'm listening.

01:07:09.105 --> 01:07:11.157
Did you find them?
Where?

01:07:16.692 --> 01:07:18.966
And who do you think you have found?

01:07:18.986 --> 01:07:20.132
The bus.

01:07:20.152 --> 01:07:20.296
And the ultras?
What should I do with this bus?

01:07:20.316 --> 01:07:24.093
Where are the tourists?

01:07:24.113 --> 01:07:25.539
They ran into the woods.

01:07:32.033 --> 01:07:33.458
Come on, come on!

01:08:47.906 --> 01:08:49.957
Attack!

01:09:28.426 --> 01:09:31.645
Skullhead Crew! Skullhead Crew!

01:09:45.643 --> 01:09:49.571
<i>Zenit won against Spartak with 1:0</i>

01:09:50.021 --> 01:09:51.461
<i>Peterburg's turned out to be better.</i>

01:09:51.771 --> 01:09:53.114
We need to get him to hospital.

01:09:53.773 --> 01:09:55.296
No, no...

01:09:55.316 --> 01:09:57.075
What 'no'?

01:09:57.607 --> 01:09:58.964
I can make it.

01:09:58.984 --> 01:10:00.327
To Moscow?

01:10:01.985 --> 01:10:04.912
We need to call an ambulance
when we get close.

01:10:06.905 --> 01:10:08.538
Are you sure you can make it?

01:10:14.409 --> 01:10:16.461
I've been living for so many years...

01:10:16.910 --> 01:10:18.640
and I can't understand anything.

01:10:18.660 --> 01:10:20.962
Anything at all.

01:10:23.456 --> 01:10:25.436
Politics, business, money.

01:10:25.456 --> 01:10:27.299
I can't understand a thing.

01:10:30.541 --> 01:10:32.606
And here it's all clear.

01:10:32.626 --> 01:10:35.137
I'm here and there's the enemy.

01:10:36.378 --> 01:10:37.817
I'm standing.

01:10:37.837 --> 01:10:42.931
Attack, attack and you hit till he
gives you a sign that he gives up.

01:10:43.256 --> 01:10:44.807
Like how?

01:10:47.842 --> 01:10:50.032
You don't hit a man down.

01:10:50.052 --> 01:10:53.979
Those are the rules, fairplay if you want.

01:10:54.637 --> 01:10:57.022
Why do you fight?

01:10:59.432 --> 01:11:02.233
What else should we do?
Play football, maybe?

01:11:10.145 --> 01:11:11.906
Hello, dad!
Where's my brother?

01:11:17.567 --> 01:11:19.201
It's alright, boys.

01:11:19.526 --> 01:11:21.173
Have a sit for a while.

01:11:21.193 --> 01:11:23.787
Okay, dad, I understand.

01:11:32.449 --> 01:11:34.221
Yaryi, what's wrong?

01:11:34.241 --> 01:11:36.084
I just talked to my dad.

01:11:37.368 --> 01:11:40.877
Some immigrants gave my brother a beating,
near cafe 'Joseffina'.

01:11:43.622 --> 01:11:45.255
He's in hospital now.

01:11:54.668 --> 01:11:56.094
Fuck!

01:11:58.630 --> 01:12:00.777
Yaryi, listen - we must get
some details first.

01:12:00.797 --> 01:12:02.362
We can't just go around, beating everybody.

01:12:02.382 --> 01:12:04.112
You want an investigation?!

01:12:04.132 --> 01:12:07.508
They just came out of the woods and
are acting like kings already.

01:12:07.533 --> 01:12:09.042
Maybe call their parents, eh?

01:12:09.469 --> 01:12:13.618
We must understand first - who and why!

01:12:13.638 --> 01:12:15.576
Of course! I'll go find out right now.

01:12:15.596 --> 01:12:17.784
Where do they hang out usually?
Cafe 'Joseffina'?

01:12:17.804 --> 01:12:19.536
I'm going to investigate, Ok?

01:12:19.556 --> 01:12:24.443
Yaryi! We didn't creat the crew
to go around beating up muslims.

01:12:25.601 --> 01:12:29.124
Mates, some muslims gave my brother
a beating in the hood.

01:12:29.144 --> 01:12:32.905
What do you say? Shall we?
Let's go spill some of their blood.

01:12:36.856 --> 01:12:38.199
Major!

01:12:38.733 --> 01:12:40.075
Say something!

01:12:42.067 --> 01:12:43.298
Teacher.

01:12:43.318 --> 01:12:44.882
What can I say?

01:12:44.902 --> 01:12:49.343
"Sorry, mate, that your brother
happens to be in hospital."

01:12:49.363 --> 01:12:52.388
If it were because of The Horses or Zenit,
you'd go fighting.

01:12:52.408 --> 01:12:53.846
But otherwise - not?

01:12:53.866 --> 01:12:56.763
"They are not a part of
the around the football".

01:12:56.783 --> 01:12:59.669
"Maybe wait for them to
go for our families, eh?"

01:13:06.997 --> 01:13:08.854
You are ruining the crew!

01:13:08.874 --> 01:13:10.730
No, you are doing it!

01:13:10.750 --> 01:13:12.092
Come on, hit me!

01:13:13.126 --> 01:13:15.635
If you don't want to come, just say so.

01:13:16.586 --> 01:13:18.554
Here: Yaryi, I'm not coming!

01:13:19.170 --> 01:13:20.722
It's your choice, mate.

01:13:23.756 --> 01:13:25.098
Yaryi!

01:13:25.341 --> 01:13:27.070
Let's organise it first!

01:13:27.090 --> 01:13:28.321
One for all!

01:13:28.341 --> 01:13:29.573
And all for one!

01:13:29.593 --> 01:13:31.240
I'm serious!

01:13:31.260 --> 01:13:33.019
I am, too!

01:13:58.775 --> 01:14:00.325
What do you want from me?

01:14:00.857 --> 01:14:03.339
I told you not to call me anymore.

01:14:03.359 --> 01:14:04.703
I'm sick of you.

01:14:05.152 --> 01:14:06.911
What does that mean?

01:14:08.071 --> 01:14:09.497
Who are you to command me?

01:14:09.947 --> 01:14:12.539
I can decide for myself who to call or not.

01:14:12.863 --> 01:14:14.833
And who to call again.

01:14:15.659 --> 01:14:19.501
If it's not enough - I'll
follow you everywhere.

01:14:20.035 --> 01:14:21.587
I'll do anything

01:14:21.829 --> 01:14:23.587
I consider necessary to

01:14:26.413 --> 01:14:28.047
get you to be with me.

01:14:30.040 --> 01:14:31.687
All clear?

01:14:31.707 --> 01:14:32.939
Yes, good bye!

01:14:32.959 --> 01:14:34.189
Igor, wait!

01:14:34.209 --> 01:14:35.886
Farewell!

01:14:38.169 --> 01:14:40.263
And don't you dare follow me.

01:14:56.512 --> 01:14:59.230
I brought you a T-shirt.

01:15:01.931 --> 01:15:04.316
God, why are you punishing me?
What do you want from me?

01:15:09.226 --> 01:15:11.320
You think we don't hit girls?

01:15:13.104 --> 01:15:14.655
But we do!

01:15:15.188 --> 01:15:16.738
Come on, hit me!

01:15:51.124 --> 01:15:52.675
Come here, you cunt!

01:16:32.185 --> 01:16:33.529
Seroja, the kitchen!

01:16:36.563 --> 01:16:37.906
Give me the bottle!

01:16:40.314 --> 01:16:42.283
Get out!

01:17:42.640 --> 01:17:44.941
Let's get out of here!

01:18:10.904 --> 01:18:12.537
Okay, it's all clear.
Bye!

01:18:19.450 --> 01:18:21.085
Hey, Yaryi!

01:18:22.160 --> 01:18:23.711
What's going on here?

01:18:27.788 --> 01:18:29.338
What is that?

01:18:31.331 --> 01:18:32.673
Vitamins.

01:18:35.084 --> 01:18:37.550
You piece of shit, are you selling
drugs in my hood?

01:18:37.585 --> 01:18:39.024
No, man, we haven't seen each other
for a while and...

01:18:39.044 --> 01:18:40.691
Then what's that?
Candy?

01:18:40.711 --> 01:18:43.484
Take it easy, man...

01:18:43.504 --> 01:18:44.859
Get your hands off me!

01:18:44.879 --> 01:18:47.056
If I see you once again, do you understand?

01:19:01.555 --> 01:19:02.993
Yaryi... What?!

01:19:03.013 --> 01:19:05.608
Where did he shoot you?
Yaryi... Slav?!

01:19:06.641 --> 01:19:08.316
Slav, brother...

01:19:11.979 --> 01:19:14.778
We need an ambulance!

01:19:28.861 --> 01:19:30.509
Yaryi, what happened?

01:19:30.529 --> 01:19:31.968
Do you hear me?!

01:19:31.988 --> 01:19:32.884
What happened?

01:19:32.904 --> 01:19:33.927
Gun shot.

01:19:33.947 --> 01:19:35.497
Yaryi, who was it?!

01:19:36.865 --> 01:19:38.429
What happened here?
Did somebody see?

01:19:38.449 --> 01:19:40.833
Igor, it was a muslim.

01:19:40.950 --> 01:19:42.500
Yaryi!
Enough.

01:20:35.355 --> 01:20:37.405
Slav was a legend.

01:20:38.563 --> 01:20:40.239
Accept our condolences.

01:21:23.920 --> 01:21:25.860
The cops won't do anything.

01:21:25.880 --> 01:21:27.973
It's not clear who shot him.

01:21:29.339 --> 01:21:30.974
Try to find out more yourselfves.

01:21:31.925 --> 01:21:33.683
We will, of course.

01:21:34.216 --> 01:21:35.989
We'll also ask around.

01:21:36.009 --> 01:21:39.950
The cops will close the case soon anyway.

01:21:39.970 --> 01:21:42.020
What did you expect?

01:21:44.432 --> 01:21:46.286
Hello, mates!

01:21:46.306 --> 01:21:47.537
Is everything on for Friday?

01:21:47.557 --> 01:21:48.788
As we agreed, everything's okay.

01:21:48.808 --> 01:21:50.456
Okay, we'll keep in touch.

01:21:50.476 --> 01:21:52.026
We will.

01:21:54.437 --> 01:21:57.028
Here's the deal: Yaryi got killed by
a guy named Aslan.

01:21:57.979 --> 01:21:59.419
A cop under cover.

01:21:59.439 --> 01:22:01.322
They won't even check the case.

01:22:02.565 --> 01:22:03.921
Who told you that?

01:22:03.941 --> 01:22:07.575
There are people who would tell you
anything you want for money.

01:22:08.192 --> 01:22:09.551
And now what?

01:22:09.571 --> 01:22:11.619
That changes everything.

01:22:12.070 --> 01:22:13.496
In what way?

01:22:14.237 --> 01:22:15.788
In any way.

01:22:19.989 --> 01:22:22.042
Why did you call me at all?

01:22:22.284 --> 01:22:24.348
We didn't call you, we ordered you.

01:22:24.368 --> 01:22:26.127
And why is that?

01:22:26.453 --> 01:22:28.837
Because you shot your own friend, Plotnikov.

01:22:29.162 --> 01:22:30.476
Me?!

01:22:30.496 --> 01:22:32.769
Aslan shot him, I stood aside.

01:22:32.789 --> 01:22:35.812
Aslan was there to rush

01:22:35.832 --> 01:22:37.467
an operative worker under cover.

01:22:37.584 --> 01:22:39.884
There's no way he shot him.

01:22:40.502 --> 01:22:42.260
Do you understand me?

01:22:44.253 --> 01:22:47.389
What are you doing?! You have set me
up enough already.

01:22:47.589 --> 01:22:49.140
I understand.

01:22:53.633 --> 01:22:55.489
But there's nobody, except you.

01:22:55.509 --> 01:22:59.561
And the only way to avoid going to prison
for a long time,

01:23:00.637 --> 01:23:03.229
is to give me your other friend.

01:23:04.054 --> 01:23:07.607
Toloknov, or what you call him...

01:23:07.932 --> 01:23:09.357
Teacher.

01:23:12.185 --> 01:23:13.943
Why not the Major?

01:23:14.810 --> 01:23:16.666
I said I want Teacher.

01:23:16.686 --> 01:23:18.321
The rest is none of your business.

01:23:25.525 --> 01:23:32.300
<i>Today, on stadim "Lujniki" will be held the
cup final between Spartak and CSKA.</i>

01:23:32.320 --> 01:23:38.970
<i>This derby is soon after the death of
one of the most famous fans of Spartak.</i>

01:23:38.990 --> 01:23:41.874
<i>The stadium will be with high
police attendance.</i>

01:23:42.324 --> 01:23:43.875
Mom, dad, I'm leaving.

01:23:44.076 --> 01:23:46.889
They were just saying that
riots are expected today.

01:23:46.909 --> 01:23:48.877
Everything will be fine.
Don't worry.

01:24:07.546 --> 01:24:09.227
Death for the Meat.
(a nickname of Spartak)

01:24:30.767 --> 01:24:32.442
Go, Spartak!

01:25:39.885 --> 01:25:41.324
Yes, hello?

01:25:41.344 --> 01:25:42.687
Hello?

01:25:47.681 --> 01:25:49.148
I can't hear a thing!

01:25:50.183 --> 01:25:51.524
Write me a text!

01:26:00.813 --> 01:26:02.905
We are all going after the match.

01:26:08.024 --> 01:26:09.882
Razor, what's wrong with you today?

01:26:09.902 --> 01:26:11.424
I got a stomach ache.

01:26:11.444 --> 01:26:13.327
I'll be right back.

01:26:30.536 --> 01:26:33.643
On the triple crossroads of "Kutuzov".

01:26:33.663 --> 01:26:39.173
I see, so we are taking everybody today.
Don't be there because I can't save you.

01:26:41.041 --> 01:26:42.717
Get ouf ot there, you hear me?

01:26:52.504 --> 01:26:56.892
If I said we can make it, then I mean it.

01:26:57.508 --> 01:26:59.057
Fuck!

01:26:59.594 --> 01:27:01.144
They will have problems, not us.

01:27:02.928 --> 01:27:06.147
Tell them to prepare all documents,
that's all.

01:27:27.232 --> 01:27:28.992
Razor left.

01:27:29.316 --> 01:27:30.659
Fuck!

01:27:45.784 --> 01:27:47.208
The primates are here.

01:27:47.868 --> 01:27:49.293
We wait.

01:27:50.370 --> 01:27:53.587
Don't succumb to provokations. We are
a democratic country.

01:28:05.168 --> 01:28:07.844
Don't do anything.

01:28:08.795 --> 01:28:10.470
Wait for the order.

01:28:25.678 --> 01:28:27.022
We all wait for the order.

01:28:38.394 --> 01:28:40.361
Well, Teacher, are you ready?

01:28:41.021 --> 01:28:42.127
We all are.

01:28:42.147 --> 01:28:43.710
Are you sure your won't flee?

01:28:43.730 --> 01:28:45.781
If they hit them hard, they will.

01:28:52.984 --> 01:28:55.368
For Yaryi!!!

01:28:55.611 --> 01:28:56.925
For Yaryi!

01:28:56.945 --> 01:28:58.620
For Yaryi!

01:29:01.947 --> 01:29:03.415
What, the fuck, is happening?

01:29:05.282 --> 01:29:07.042
What do they think they're doing?!

01:29:36.549 --> 01:29:38.934
Hold!

01:29:45.095 --> 01:29:47.189
Hold!

01:29:50.848 --> 01:29:52.608
Hold your positions!

01:30:00.019 --> 01:30:04.033
The Court finds guilty Alexander
Yurevich Sobolev to have committed

01:30:04.058 --> 01:30:07.377
a crime on Article 1, Paragrah
213 from the Penalty Code.

01:30:07.397 --> 01:30:11.575
The sentence is one year probation.

01:30:11.692 --> 01:30:15.601
The Court finds guilty Vladimir
Petrovich Vetrov to have committed

01:30:15.626 --> 01:30:18.967
a crime on Article 1, Paragrah
213 from the Penalty Code.

01:30:18.987 --> 01:30:23.428
The sentence is one year probation.

01:30:23.448 --> 01:30:27.247
The Court finds guilty Igor
Sergeevich Toloknov to have

01:30:27.272 --> 01:30:31.475
committed a crime on Paragrah
212, 213 from the Penalty Code.

01:30:31.994 --> 01:30:35.726
The latter is sentenced to
five years imprisonment.

01:30:35.746 --> 01:30:39.089
The sentence will be
served in a state prison.

01:30:39.290 --> 01:30:41.882
The Court is adjourned.

01:30:46.167 --> 01:30:49.386
God, what's this nonsence?!

01:31:02.010 --> 01:31:05.020
Hang in there, mate.
We are with you.

01:31:27.647 --> 01:31:30.241
You've lost weight...

01:31:42.239 --> 01:31:44.541
What's wrong, Razor?

01:31:45.574 --> 01:31:47.124
Did you got nuts already?

01:31:53.910 --> 01:31:55.879
Well?

01:31:57.163 --> 01:31:58.588
What did you think?

01:31:59.538 --> 01:32:00.881
It's unreal, really.

01:32:01.415 --> 01:32:03.175
It's all normal.

01:32:14.256 --> 01:32:15.888
How is it?

01:32:20.383 --> 01:32:21.822
Top quality, boys.

01:32:21.842 --> 01:32:23.186
It's perfect!

01:32:26.011 --> 01:32:28.074
You?

01:32:28.094 --> 01:32:29.440
We'll skip this time.

01:32:32.472 --> 01:32:34.648
Oh, come on, take it.

01:32:35.932 --> 01:32:37.983
No, we'll really skip it.

01:33:01.862 --> 01:33:03.414
Take care!

01:33:10.617 --> 01:33:12.167
Hey there, mates!

01:33:16.037 --> 01:33:18.628
Your ex's leaving.
